# Keep every tracked text file LF in the repository and in every checkout.
# Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true rewrites lib/client.js to
# CRLF, so `node tools/build.mjs --check` reports a false "product mismatch" even
# though the committed bytes are correct. The installed runtime is unaffected; this
# only makes a downloaded copy build/check identically on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
